     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Line 44 &amp; 46 logic problem</div><div><br></div><div>Simplify your code:</div><div><div>for(k in c(1:61)){</div><div>  for(x in c(1:24)){     a[[k]] &lt;- x     }</div><div>}</div></div><div>loop 1 when k =1, x = 1 ,  a[[1]] &lt;- 1</div><div>loop 2 when k =1, x = 2 ,  a[[1]] &lt;- 2<br></div><div>..</div><div>..</div><div>loop 24 when k =1, x = 24 ,  a[[1]] &lt;- 24</div><div>..</div><div>..</div><div>Loop from 1 to 23 are meaningless(replace by a[[1]] &lt;- 24)</div><div><br></div><div>FYR:</div><div><div>kx &lt;- vector(&quot;list&quot;, length = 61)</div><div>for(k in c(1:61)){</div><div>  for(x in c(1:24)){    kx[[k]][[x]] &lt;- paste(k,x,sep=&#39;_&#39;)    }</div><div>}</div></div></div>"
